  "ruleText": "Env-A 1701.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish the requirements for applications submitted to the department for certain permits issued under RSA 125-C.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7886, 5-3-03; ss by #9907, INTERIM, eff 5-3-11, EXPIRES: 10-31-11, ss by #10001, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12965, eff 1-6-20",
